  "nodes": {
    "opening": {
      "node_id": "opening",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "希博公路酒馆的前厅被煤油灯照得发黄，吧台上有没擦干的水痕，杯底碰木板的声音断断续续。通往地下酒吧的窄楼梯在吧台侧后方，下面传来低笑、鞋跟和门轴声，任何抬高的句子都会被那道楼梯接住。露西站在酒桶旁分拣杯子，袖口卷到手肘，指节沾着柠檬皮的湿亮。你靠近时，她没有立刻抬头，只把一只空杯推到你面前，杯口朝外，像是给谈话留了一个普通顾客的外壳。靠窗角落坐着一个陌生男人，桌上没有酒，只有摊开的报纸；纸页遮住他半张脸，露出的眼睛能越过报纸边缘看见吧台和露西。露西把杯布搭回肩上，视线在你的嘴唇和窗边之间短短移了一次。\n\n「声音放低。这里有人听闲话，也有人专听不该听的词。」\n\n「别在吧台上说小屋、钥匙、教授、铁盒。你要是来买酒，就像个买酒的人。」\n\n「靠窗那个没点酒，报纸翻了三次，一口水都没要。他看的不是你。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_1",
          "text": "我不说那些词，慢慢来。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_line_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_2",
          "text": "我付钱，拿话就走。",
          "target_node_id": "money_line_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_3",
          "text": "我先看窗边和楼梯。",
          "target_node_id": "watch_corner",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_4",
          "text": "莱特的事，不说会更麻烦。",
          "target_node_id": "pressure_line_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_line_b1": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_line_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把杯子往自己这边收了半寸，杯底擦过木面，声音很轻。她没有看靠窗角落，只把手肘压在吧台边缘，挡住嘴角的动作。\n\n「好，慢慢来。你别把声音抬起来，我就说方位。」\n\n「莱特在希博公路北侧有一间旧测绘小屋，那个词别在这里重复。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_line_b1_continue",
          "text": "从哪边过去？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_line_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_line_b2": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_line_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "靠窗那张报纸翻了一页，纸声短促。露西停到声音落下，才用指尖在湿木面上划出一条弯线，又很快抹掉。\n\n「从哪边？别走主路。」\n\n「从酒馆后方那条土路绕，看到第七码碑，再找一根断了半截的电线杆。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_line_b2_continue",
          "text": "到了以后找什么？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_line_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_line_b3": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_line_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把抹布搭回杯架，动作比刚才慢。她的视线掠过你肩侧，又落回杯沿，像是在确认每个字都只停在这片吧台里。\n\n「到了以后别乱翻显眼处。」\n\n「莱特把一只小铁盒留在那里。他只说会有人来拿，没说让我打开。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_line_b3_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_line_b4",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_line_b4": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_line_b4",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把擦杯子的布摊平在吧台上，指尖压住布角。靠窗那边，报纸翻过一页，纸边挡住了男人的半张脸；你能看见他桌面仍是空的。\n\n「你记下就好，别在这儿翻出来念。」\n\n「那只小铁盒里是什么，我不知道，莱特也没让我碰。门要是锁着，先看雨桶底下；他以前爱把能开门的那枚塞在桶底边。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_line_b4_continue",
          "text": "他还留下别的吗？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_line_b5",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_line_b5": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_line_b5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西没有立刻接话。她把一只空杯推到水渍外侧，杯底在木面上蹭出很轻的一声，随后才抬眼看你。\n\n「留下的没有，来过倒是真的。」\n\n「他死前那晚到过这里，手上沾着黑色粉末，指缝里也有，洗了两遍还没干净。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_line_b5_continue",
          "text": "他当时说了什么？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_private_line_b6",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_private_line_b6": {
      "node_id": "soft_private_line_b6",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "靠窗的报纸停了一下，又慢慢落回原处。露西把声音压得更低，手指沿着杯口转了一圈，没有再碰那块湿布。\n\n「你问他说什么？他只说了一句怪话。」\n\n「‘屋子外面只有二十步宽，里面量出来却多了四步。’我只当他那晚脑子不清醒。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_private_line_b6_continue",
          "text": "我知道了。",
          "target_node_id": "end_soft_leave",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "end_soft_leave": {
      "node_id": "end_soft_leave",
      "type": "end",
      "narration": "露西听见你那句“我知道了”，把杯沿在抹布上转了半圈，才松开手。角落男人的报纸仍停在同一页，纸边遮住半张脸。你把北侧旧测绘小屋、酒馆后方土路、第七码碑、断杆、小铁盒和雨桶底下的钥匙记在身上，推门离开时，楼下的低声谈笑被门板压回去。\n\n「知道了就别回头看。」露西说。\n\n「我今晚只是在擦杯子。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": []
    },
    "money_line_b1": {
      "node_id": "money_line_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西没有立刻伸手，只把指尖压在桌沿，视线从钱上移到靠窗角落。那张报纸仍摊着，杯口的位置没有水痕。她把声音压低，嘴唇几乎不多动。\n\n「付钱可以，拿话就走也可以。希博公路北边，有间莱特用过的旧测绘屋，你只要记这个方位。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_money_line_b1_continue",
          "text": "北边具体怎么走？",
          "target_node_id": "money_line_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "money_line_b2": {
      "node_id": "money_line_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西用指甲轻轻敲了一下桌面，像是在截断更响的问法。她没有看窗边，只把钱往自己这边拢了半寸，又停住。\n\n「你问怎么走，就听短的：别沿主路直找。」\n\n「从酒馆后面那条土路绕过去，路能把你带到附近。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_money_line_b2_continue",
          "text": "路上认什么标记？",
          "target_node_id": "money_line_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "money_line_b3": {
      "node_id": "money_line_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "露西把钱收进掌心，手指合拢得很快。窗边的报纸翻过一角，又落回桌面；她等那点纸声过去，才继续说。\n\n「认第七码碑，还有一根断了半截的电线杆。两个都看见，就别再往亮处走。」\n\n「莱特留下过一只小铁盒，我只知道有这么个东西，别在这里问它在哪。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_lucy",
      "location_ref": "scene_hibo_roadhouse",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_money_line_b3_continue",
